What is Top-K Retrieval?

Returning the K most relevant chunks.

What is Metadata Filtering?

Restricting search using metadata.

What is MMR Retrieval?

Returns relevant and diverse results.

What is Multi-Query Retrieval?

Generates multiple search queries to improve recall.

What is Score Threshold Retrieval?

Returns chunks only above a similarity score.

Difference between Retriever and Vector DB?
Retriever	Vector DB
